(text "REUSABLE 9-AXIS CARRIER  |  3.3V HOST / LOCAL 1.8V"(at 15.24 15.24 0)(effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left))(uuid ec61ae78-b7f8-58b6-ba20-b1f17ee5fb25))
(text "J5: 1=3V3  2=GND  3=SDA  4=SCL\nPH 2.0mm side entry; straight 1:1 cable <=50mm\nInput 3.0-3.6V ONLY. No 5V, no hot-plug.\nHost open drain; DISABLE all host pull-ups."(at 20.32 175.26 0)(effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left))(uuid b4bf4adb-b4d8-5dc3-b2b8-103971873884))
(text "PCA9306: VREF2 joins EN through 200k bias.\nNever strap VREF2/EN directly to 3V3.\nBoth bus domains include their own 4.7k pulls."(at 121.92 190.5 0)(effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left))(uuid c97d0475-96fb-5a7b-af15-bfa44f4c6710))
(text "ICM: VDDIO 1.71-1.95V; VDD 1.71-3.6V\nBOTH supplied by 1.8V here. No exposed-pad land.\n18 AND 20 grounded; 19 NC. REGOUT only C9.\nC5/C6: each >=1uF EFFECTIVE required under bias."(at 215.9 218.44 0)(effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left))(uuid 9f69c395-2f0c-5e1b-a12d-4dcfbc7d6962))
(text "100kHz I2C, address 0x68; FIFO polling (INT intentionally NC). 400kHz only after <=300ns rise-time / <=60pF target qualification.\nInitialize and validate internal AK09916 magnetometer as well as accel/gyro. Startup/rundown and cap-effective checks remain bench gates.\nCarrier axes: +X PH pin1->4; +Y into PCB; +Z component face. U2 pin1 upper-left in top view: accel/gyro (X,Y,Z); mag (X,-Y,-Z).\n18x20x1mm, four layers, fourteen fitted parts. Nonconductive registered peripheral supports; no sensor-area clamping. See interface.json."(at 15.24 254.0 0)(effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left))(uuid 67647b0e-844c-56f3-b6c4-43c2b87e5227))
(sheet_instances(path "/"(page "1"))))
